    recipeInstructions: [
      'Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium-high heat. Add the onion; cook 5 minutes until softened. Add the garlic and jalapeño; cook 1 minute until fragrant.',
      'Stir in the chili powder, cumin, and oregano; cook 30 seconds. Add the crushed tomatoes and chicken broth; bring to a boil.',
      'Add the whole chicken breasts; reduce heat to medium and simmer 18 to 20 minutes until cooked through. Remove the chicken, shred with two forks, and return to the pot.',
      'Add the black beans, corn, salt, and pepper. Simmer 5 minutes to heat through. Stir in the lime juice and cilantro.',
      'Ladle into bowls and top with crushed tortilla chips.',
      'Suggestions (not included): Garnish with sliced avocado, sour cream, shredded cheese, or extra lime wedges.'
    ],
